# One-time manual setup — run with /function virtues:npc/tag_all_yew_npcs
# after placing/naming Yew's NPCs (NBT_Creator/NBT_world2, during Yew.nbt
# authoring). Tags each named villager npc_<name> for trade-completion
# advancement matching and general re-identification if the town has to be
# rebuilt from scratch.

